176			// function to return to the server loop that called
177			// it: close the listener, or set a deadline in the
178			// past. Obviously, we can't close the socket yet
179			// since others may be using it (hence this whole
180			// file). But we can set the deadline in the past,
181			// and this is kind of cheating, but it works, and
182			// it apparently even works on Windows.
183			_ = fcl.sharedListener.setDeadline()
